    "body": "I went with undefined since that's what Chrome returns, there've been no compatibility issues reported, and it seems better as a \"this really does nothing\" method.\n\nSimilarly I removed the arguments since in Edge you can't even call `.length` on these things, even though in Chrome they have a `.length` of 1.\n\nIn general I went for the most no-opey intersection semantics possible.\n",
